SUMMARY:Crystal Pite's Emergence\, and Silent Screen Ballets + Dessert (Os
 goode Stn.)
DESCRIPTION:Experience Toronto\nOn **Sunday November 15th\,** **see Emerge
 nce and Silent Screen at the National Ballet of Canada.** This dynamic dou
 ble bill celebrates the company’s innovation and global influence\, pair
 ing two groundbreaking works from leading contemporary dancemakers. Crysta
 l Pite’s award-winning *Emergence* was a breakout success that redefined
  the relationship between classical and contemporary traditions\, while *S
 ilent Screen* introduced the storied partnership of Sol León and Paul Lig
 htfoot to Toronto audiences through one of their most admired creations. T
 ogether\, these mesmerizing works embody the ambition and artistic excelle
 nce that define the National Ballet today. If you haven't tried modern\, t
 his is the perfect opportunity\, combined with the high likelihood of Rush
  discounted tickets. My seat is Ring 3\, Row B seat 321. **Purchase Emerge
 nce and Silent Screen on Sunday November 15th at 2pm.**\n\n**COST**\nRegul
 ar: $57 - 265 includes taxes and fees.\n\nRush: A limited number of ticket
 s will go on sale at 11:00am on the day of the performance\, subject to av
 ailability. Discounts vary per performance. Rush tickets are limited to tw
 o per person and can be purchased over the phone at 416 345 9595 or in per
 son at the Four Seasons Centre Box Office\, 145 Queen Street West.\n\nMeet
 up fee: $5\n\nTicket Policy: Sales are final and non-refundable.\n\n**SIGN
 ING-UP**\n\n* **Simply RSVP Yes\, [purchase](https://my.ballet.ca/3349/335
 3) your ticket for Sunday November 15th\, post your seat number and I will
  move you to attending.**\n* If you plan to buy RUSH\, please state that i
 n your RSVP\, so I can include you in the pre-mail and we can meet you.\n*
  RSVPs close Friday night\, and cancellations after will result in a No Sh
 ow and impact future attendance.\n* A reminder will go out the day before 
 with my cell and details when to meet\, etc.\n\n‐‐----‐----‐‐---
 ----------‐-----------\n**MEETUP TIME**\n**Meet me at 1:45pm** **along t
 he right glass wall\, after scanning your tickets and entering The Four Se
 asons Centre for the Performing Arts at 145 Queen St. W.**\n\n**Ballet sta
 rt time: 2pm**\n\nLength: 1 hours 40 mins (incl. 1 intermission)\n\nEnjoy 
 and please post your Comments after!
