SUMMARY:A Talent for Murder with Helen Mirren + Dinner (Queen St. E.)
DESCRIPTION:Experience Toronto\nOn **Sunday November 15th\,** let's see **
 A Talent for Murder with Helen Mirren and Olivia Cooke.** This smoldering 
 chamber thriller follows a mysterious young man\, Alden Ehrenreich (Weapon
 s) from a New York publisher\, who is sent to Switzerland to persuade the 
 renowned writer Patricia Highsmith (Helen Mirren) to write one final insta
 llment of the Ripley anthology. Seating is general admission. **Purchase y
 our ticket for A Talent for Murder on Sunday November 15th at 6pm at Fox T
 heatre in The Beach.**\n\n**COST**\nAdult Non-member $14.38/ Fox Classic M
 ember $10.84 + fees\n\n**SIGNING UP**\n\n* **Simply RSVP Yes confirming Ye
 s/No to food/drinks after (reservations required)**\n* **[Purchase](https:
 //www.foxtheatre.ca/movies/a-talent-for-murder/#section-buy-tickets) your 
 own ticket by selecting Sunday November 15th at 6pm and post you have your
  ticket as a Comment**\n* You can also meet the group at the meetup time w
 ith your ticket in hand\n* RSVPs close 1 day prior and cancellations may b
 e marked as a No Show and may impact future attendance.\n\n**MEETUP TIME**
 \n**Meet me at: 5:45pm inside the front doors of Fox Theatre at 2236 Queen
  St. E. FYI\, I will be hosting another meetup before and driving directly
  there.**\n\n**Show starts**: **6pm**\n\nLength: 1 hour 46 minutes\n\nAfte
 r: meet me outside the auditorium to head to dinner and chat about the mov
 ie\n\nEnjoy and please post your comments in the event after.
