SUMMARY:Virtual Register: Retirement and Estate Planning (Toronto)
DESCRIPTION:Experience Toronto\n**Note: In addition to RSVPing Yes\, you w
 ill also need to register below for your link to the event.**\n\nOn **Wedn
 esday\, November 18th\,** **join this webinar on Retirement and Estate Pla
 nning.** November is Financial Literacy Month. It's always a good time to 
 review your finances and long-term needs\, and to get estate planning in p
 lace. Christine Cardoso hosts this discussion with financial experts about
  the ins-and-outs of retirement and estate planning. Together\, they’ll 
 debunk some common myths and explore proven strategies for building estate
  wealth and meeting long-term goals. **Please register for Retirement and 
 Estate Planning Explained on Wednesday\, November 18th.**\n\n**COST**\nFre
 e\n\n**SIGNING UP**\n\n* Simply RSVP Yes\n* **[Register](https://www.event
 brite.ca/e/retirement-estate-planning-explained-online-audience-tickets-20
 04027880337)** for your link to the event. You will receive a confirmation
  email. A few minutes before start time\, click on the link in your email\
 , sign in to your Eventbrite account\, scroll down and click on the Join N
 ow button\,\n* **Start time: 12 noon**\n* Length: 1.5 hours\n*\n* RSVPs cl
 ose 2 days before\n\nEnjoy and please post your Comments after!
