SUMMARY:30% off The Parfumerie + Pre-Dinner + Post Dessert at The Distille
 ry District
DESCRIPTION:Experience Toronto\n**Note: The sale ends on September 7th at 
 11\;59pm. Theatre tickets allow free and skip-the-line entry into The Dist
 illery District for this show.**\n\n**On Saturday\, November 28th\, see** 
 **The Parfumerie at The Distillery District**. On a snowy night in downtow
 n Budapest\, a perfumery hums with chatter\, gossip\, and the spark of rom
 ance. Behind elegant counters\, clerks scramble through the holiday rush a
 s a secret love ignites.Tender\, sharp\, and riotously funny: *Parfumerie*
  is a romantic comedy about yearning\, connection\, and the leap of faith 
 love demands. My seat is Balcony AA9. **Purchase The Parfumerie on Saturda
 y\, November 28th at 7pm.**\n\n**COST**\nRegular: $115/$135\n\nSale: $73.5
 0/$93.50 with code WEEKENDBOGO\n\nRush: It there are any\, they will be av
 ailable online at 8:00 AM that morning from $32 -$40 with [code](26RUSH26)
 \n\nMeetup Organizer Fee: $5\n\nTicket Policy: All sales are final.\n\n**S
 IGNING-UP**\n\n* **RSVP\, confirming if you will join for dinner before\, 
 as reservations are required**\n* **[Purchase](https://my.soulpepper.ca/16
 064/16172) your own ticket for Saturday November 28th at 7pm\, and post yo
 ur seat number in the Comment section. I will then move you to attending.*
 *\n* Members can also show up at the Theatre with their ticket in hand.\n\
 nRSVPs close 2 days prior and cancellations may result in a No Show and im
 pact future attendance.\n\nA reminder will be sent the day before with my 
 cell and reminder details where to meet and when.\n\n**MEETUP TIME**\n**Me
 et me for Dinner at: 5:15pm in front of Restaurant** **TBC** (I can only m
 ake the reservation 2 weeks prior)\n\n**Meet me for the show at: 6:45pm in
  the line for the Baillie Theatre inside the Young Centre for the Performi
 ng Arts in the Distillery District at 50 Tankhouse Lane**\n\n**Show Starts
 **: **7pm**\n\nLength: estimate 2 hours\n\n**After: meet at the same spot 
 to chat about the show/ head out for a beverage/dessert across the street*
 *\n\nEnjoy and please post your comments in the Event after.
