SUMMARY:Dirty Dancing: The Musical on its way to Broadway  + Dinner (Dunda
 s Station)
DESCRIPTION:Experience Toronto\nOn **Sunday\, December 6th\, get ready to 
 have the time of your life with** ***DIRTY DANCING: THE MUSICAL***! Based 
 on Lionsgate's beloved film\, the story that awakened a generation is back
  in a new stage production. ***DIRTY DANCING: THE MUSICAL***  is the fee
 l-good escape you’ve been craving\, alive with the pulse of electrified 
 dancing\, the thrill of secret encounters\, and the allure of forbidden ro
 mance. Set to live music from the original film you love\, Baby and Johnny
  bring to life the summer that changed everything. My seat is Orchestra M2
 5. **Purchase** ***DIRTY DANCING: THE MUSICAL* on Sunday December 6th at 2
 pm.**\n\n**COST**\nRegular Cost: $59/ 79/ 99/ 129/ 149/ 219 + service fees
 \n\nMeetup Organizer Fee: $5\n\n**Ticket Policy**: All sales are final\, n
 o refunds or exchanges.\n\n**SIGNING-UP**\n\n* **RSVP Yes confirming if yo
 u will join for dinner after. Note: everyone goes on the waitlist until th
 ey post their seat number**\n* **[Purchase](https://tickets.mirvish.com/dd
 26/24439)** **your own ticket and select Sunday December 6th at 2pm**\, po
 st your seat number and I will move you to going.\n\nA reminder will be se
 nt the day before with my cell and reminder details where to meet and when
 .\n\nRSVPs close 2 days prior\, and the Waitlist will be removed at that t
 ime. Cancellations will result in a No Show and impact future attendance.\
 n\n**MEETUP TIME**\n**Meet me for the Show at: 1:40pm inside the front doo
 rs of the CAA Ed Mirvish Theatre at 244 Victoria St. (not Yonge St. entran
 ce) to the right side after scanning your tickets.**\n\n**Start: 2pm**\n\n
 Length: 2 hours 30 mins (incl. intermission)\n\nAfter: meet at the same sp
 ot to chat about the show and head out for our Dinner\n\nEnjoy and please 
 post your comments in the Event after.
