SUMMARY:Holiday Dinner at Michelin Recommended Restaurant Bar Eugenie (Har
 bord St)
DESCRIPTION:Experience Toronto\n**On Sunday\, December 6th\, join us for O
 ur Holiday Dinner at 2026 Michelin Recommended Bar Eugenie.** The team beh
 ind this addition to Harbord Street’s increasingly epic food scene met w
 hile working for the Alo Food Group. Bar Eugenie is an ingredient-driven r
 estaurant and bar that brings global flavours to the heart of Harbord Vill
 age. Their cozy\, lively space is made for gathering—whether around our 
 bar or at one of their intimately set tables. This neighborhood restaurant
  pays homage to Eugénie Brazier\, the legendary French chef often referre
 d to as the "mother of French cooking" and the first person to earn six Mi
 chelin Stars in 1933 (three each at two different restaurants). It's a nei
 ghborhood spot\, where the food and atmosphere are meant to be enjoyed\, w
 hile the menu leans classic and comforting while remaining firmly ingredie
 nt focused.\n\n**COST**\nOrganizer Meetup fee: $5\n\nAn etransfer of $35 (
 includes $5 meetup fee) is required to reserve your spot\, as I have provi
 ded my credit card for the reservation.\n\n**SIGNING-UP**\n\n* RSVP Yes. E
 veryone goes on the waitlist until they have reserved their seat\, with an
  etransfer of $35 (includes $5 meetup fee). Attendees will receive back $3
 0 by etransfer the day after the event.\n* Once you are on the waitlist\, 
 I will message you the email address for the etransfer.\n* Once the transf
 er is complete\, I will move you to attending. There are no refunds for an
 y reason\, especially as this is the Holiday season.\n* It is recommended 
 you sign up early\, as it is highly unlikely I will be able to update the 
 reservation closer to the event date.\n* A reminder will be sent the night
  before with my cell and all meetup details. Make sure you set up your com
 munication settings to receive.\n\nRSVPs close Tuesday of that week. Cance
 llations will result in a No Show and impact future attendance.\n\n**MEETU
 P TIME**\n**Meet me at: 5:15pm inside the front doors of Bar Eugenie at 89
  Harbord St.** Please wait for me to arrive\, and do not get seated prior\
 , as I have requested a specific table.\n\nLength: 2.25 hours\n\nEnjoy and
  please post your Comments in the event after.
