SUMMARY:Free/PWYC Double Feature You've Got Mail + Winter Village (Distill
 ery District)
DESCRIPTION:Experience Toronto\n**Note: I recommend obtaining your ticket 
 as soon as possible\, as there are a limited number of seats**\n\n**On Tue
 sday\, December 8th\, see** **Soulpepper's Double Feature** **You've Got M
 ail and Shop Around the Corner\, plus get free\, skip-the-line entry into 
 the famous Winter Village at The Distillery District**. Be part of **Soulp
 epper's** **first dedicated Civic Programming lineup** rooted in a simple 
 belief: arts spaces should also be public spaces\, where people can experi
 ence culture\, exchange ideas and connect\, with or without a ticket. All 
 seats are general addminssion. **Purchase your Free/PWYC ticket for You've
  Got Mail and Shop Around the Corner on Tuesday\, December 8th at 7pm.**\n
